sequenceDiagram
  actor Client as cURL client
  participant Gateway as Gateway :3000
  participant Products as Product service :3001
  participant File as products.json
  Note over Client,File: GET /products/1 tested after creating Notebook (id 1)
  Client->>Gateway: GET /products/1
  Gateway->>Gateway: Validate route/method; no admin needed for GET
  Gateway->>Products: GET /products/1 + internal gateway credential
  Products->>Products: Check credential; match route; enter queue
  Products->>File: Read and parse JSON array
  File-->>Products: Valid product records
  Products->>Products: Find id 1; leave queue
  Products-->>Gateway: 200 application/json with Notebook record
  Gateway-->>Client: Preserve 200 and JSON body
